      "intro": "<p>The piece isn't right? That's all right. Each one is sewn by hand, and only once, so we want it to find someone it will please. Here is everything you need to send it back.</p>",
      "days_title": "You have 14 days to return it",
      "days_text": "<p>You can return anything bought in the shop within 14 days of receiving it, without giving a reason. Tell us within that time, using the form below or by email, and send the piece back. We refund you within 14 days of the withdrawal, the same way you paid. We may wait until the piece reaches us.</p>",
